0..69 Comment "// The reduct the checker applies, written out. In the explicit form,"
70..144 Comment "// a monoid standing where a semigroup is asked is written as the reduct\'s"
145..222 Comment "// call, `Monoid.Semigroup(endoMonoid)`; the sugared form leaves that call to"
223..298 Comment "// the checker. The formatter writes the call where the checker applies the"
299..374 Comment "// reduct and keeps it here, and the run reads the same application in both"
375..384 Comment "// forms."
385..387 Comment "//"
388..403 Comment "// - see: #2030"
